cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Pellet heating simulator for fast firing
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mormeneo Segarra
    given-names: Andrés
    affiliation: Universitat Jaume I
repository-code: "https://github.com/EcerUnit/fast-firing-heating-simulator"
abstract: >-
  Transient axisymmetric finite-volume model of a ceramic pellet heated in a
  preheated furnace, with non-linearised radiation, temperature-dependent
  properties on an enthalpy formulation, a two-layer sample/setter mesh, and
  a sensitivity analysis of the inputs. Written for fast firing of NASICON
  solid electrolytes.
keywords:
  - fast firing
  - sintering
  - heat transfer
  - finite volume
  - solid electrolytes
  - LATP
license: MIT
version: "7.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-13"
